<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank data show fall in net reserves.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank data show fall in net reserves.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank data released on Friday show that net currency reserves fell to about 102.7 billion marks in the week ending June 23 from about 102.9 in the week ending June 15.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following reserve data: (in billion marks)</p>
<p>    Banking week ended		    June 23	 June 15</p>
<p>    Gross currency reserves	     118.4	   118.6</p>
<p>    Foreign liabilities		   15.7	    15.7</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
